OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786105098
OL,3,CNearly 10,000 people referred to UK
OL,4,Canti-terror programme in decade high
OL,6,FNearly 10,000 people have been
OL,7,Freported to the government's anti-
OL,8,Fterrorism programme with referrals
OL,9,Freaching their highest level in a
OL,10,Fdecade.
OL,12,FA record 10,293 referrals were made to
OL,13,FPrevent for 9,957 people in the year
OL,14,Fto September 2025, official figures
OL,15,Fshow.
OL,17,FThe scheme, which aims to stop people
OL,18,Ffrom being drawn into terrorism, saw
OL,19,Freferrals rise by 39% from 7,408 in
OL,20,Fthe previous 12 months.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/10
