SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786105098
OL,3,CNearly 10,000 people referred to UK
OL,4,Canti-terror programme in decade high
OL,6,FAccording to Home Office data, it is
OL,7,Fthe highest annual number of referrals
OL,8,Fsince records began in 2015.
OL,10,FOfficials recorded a sustained
OL,11,Fincrease in referrals following the
OL,12,FSouthport attack in July 2024.
OL,14,FAxel Rudakubana, who murdered three
OL,15,Fgirls at a dance class and attempted
OL,16,Fto kill eight other children and two
OL,17,Fadults, had been referred to Prevent
OL,18,Fthree times.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786105098
OL,3,CNearly 10,000 people referred to UK
OL,4,Canti-terror programme in decade high
OL,6,FHowever, his case was closed on each
OL,7,Foccasion because officials concluded
OL,8,Fthere was no clear evidence of an
OL,9,Fextremist ideology.
OL,11,FWhere age was known, children aged 11
OL,12,Fto 15 made up the largest share of
OL,13,FPrevent referrals, amounting to 3,655
OL,14,Fcases (36%), followed by 16-and 17-
OL,15,Fyear-olds with 1,379 referrals (13%),
OL,16,Fthe Home Office said.
OL,18,FA further 393 referrals (4%) involved
OL,19,Fchildren aged ten or under.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
