PN,31905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786105098
OL,3,CNearly 10,000 people referred to UK
OL,4,Canti-terror programme in decade high
OL,6,FA further 353 referrals (3%) involved
OL,7,Fmultiple ideologies, with no single
OL,8,Fdominant ideology identified.
OL,10,FMore than half of all referrals (56%)
OL,11,Finvolved individuals with no
OL,12,Fidentified ideological motivation.
OL,14,FThe Home Office has also published
OL,15,Fethnicity data for people referred to
OL,16,Fthe Prevent programme.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/10
