OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786105098
OL,3,CNearly 10,000 people referred to UK
OL,4,Canti-terror programme in decade high
OL,6,FProviding ethnicity information on the
OL,7,FPrevent referral form is not
OL,8,Fmandatory, meaning the figures cover
OL,9,F5,315 referrals in the year to
OL,10,FSeptember 2025 - around 52% of the
OL,11,Ftotal.
OL,13,FOf those referrals, 3,600 (68%)
OL,14,Finvolved people identified as white,
OL,15,F949 (18%) as Asian, 401 (8%) as black,
OL,16,Fand 365 (7%) as "other".
OL,18,FFollowing an initial assessment,
OL,19,Freferrals considered to be at risk of
OL,20,Fradicalisation can be passed to a
OL,21,Fmulti-agency "channel panel".
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNat News CNat TV FClean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F319A1786105098
OL,3,CNearly 10,000 people referred to UK
OL,4,Canti-terror programme in decade high
OL,6,FChaired by local authorities, the
OL,7,Fpanels assess a person's vulnerability
OL,8,Fto radicalisation and decide whether
OL,9,Fthey require a tailored package of
OL,10,Fsupport to address the risks.
OL,12,FOf the 1,100 referrals accepted as
OL,13,FChannel cases where ethnicity was
OL,14,Fknown, 835 (76%) involved white
OL,15,Fpeople, 159 (14%) Asian, 59 (5%)
OL,16,Fblack, and 47 (4%) "other".
OL,18,FOverall, 1,810 Prevent referrals were
OL,19,Fadopted as channel cases in the year
OL,20,Fto September, representing 18% of all
OL,21,Freferrals.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G7/10
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
