OL,3,CNearly 10,000 people referred to UK
OL,4,Canti-terror programme in decade high
OL,6,FThat is up from 11% in the previous 12-
OL,7,Fmonth period.
OL,9,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,10,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,11,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,12,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,14,F"The increases in referrals and counts
OL,15,Fof adoptions observed this year may,
OL,16,Fin part, reflect heightened public
OL,17,Fawareness of Prevent following the
OL,18,FSouthport incident in July 2024," the
OL,19,FHome Office said.
