OL,6,FDepression was the most frequently
OL,7,Frecorded mental health condition,
OL,8,Faffecting 362 people (4%), followed by
OL,9,Fanxiety disorders (313, or 3%) and
OL,10,Fpsychotic disorders (256, or 3%).
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                   G10/10
